<title>BELGIUM: Belgavia tenders for Oslo ground handling contract.</title>
<headline>Belgavia tenders for Oslo ground handling contract.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian handler, Belgavia, is hoping to become a ground handler at a new airport in Oslo, Norway.</p>
<p>Belgavia has put forward a tender and hopes to hear by the end of this month, a Belgavia spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The Belgian company is also looking for a Norwegian partner to work with the company on the Oslo ground handling contract, she added.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
